{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17845","headline":"游晋祠上李逢吉相公 · 令狐楚","name":"游晋祠上李逢吉相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不立晋祠三十年，白头重到一凄然。\n泉声自昔锵寒玉，草色虽秋耀翠钿。\n少壮同游宁有数，尊荣再会便无缘。\n相思临水下双泪，寄入幷汾向洛川。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"令狐楚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17845.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17845","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}